      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "answer_index": 2,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由函数极限的定义知，}\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0,\\,\\text{要证}\\exists X&gt;0,\\,\\text{当}|\\boldsymbol{x}|&gt;X\\text{时，有}\\circ\\\\&amp;\\frac{\\left|2x+3-\\frac{2}{3}\\right|}{3x}=\\frac{\\left|2x+3-2x\\right|}{3x}=\\frac{1}{x}&lt;\\varepsilon\\circ\\\\&amp;\\text{只须}x&gt;\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon},\\,\\text{取}X=\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon},\\,\\text{则对}\\varepsilon&gt;0,\\,\\text{当}|\\boldsymbol{x}|&gt;X\\text{时，有}\\left|\\frac{2x+3}{3x}-\\frac{2}{3}\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon,\\,\\text{即}\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\infty}\\frac{2x+3}{3x}=\\frac{2}{3}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由函数极限的定义知，}\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0,\\,\\text{要证}\\exists X&gt;0,\\,\\text{当}|\\boldsymbol{x}|&gt;X\\text{时，有}\\circ\\\\&amp;\\frac{\\left|2x+3-\\frac{2}{3}\\right|}{3x}=\\frac{\\left|2x+3-2x\\right|}{3x}=\\frac{1}{x}&lt;\\varepsilon\\circ\\\\&amp;\\text{只须}x&gt;\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon},\\,\\text{取}X=\\frac{1}{\\varepsilon},\\,\\text{则对}\\varepsilon&gt;0,\\,\\text{当}|\\boldsymbol{x}|&gt;X\\text{时，有}\\left|\\frac{2x+3}{3x}-\\frac{2}{3}\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon,\\,\\text{即}\\lim_{x\\rightarrow\\infty}\\frac{2x+3}{3x}=\\frac{2}{3}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
